      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A creature hit by the pinacosaurus's tail must attempt a DC 21 Fortitude Saving Throw save. On a failure, it's Slowed 1 until the end of its next turn; on a critical failure, it's Stunned until the end of its next turn.</p>",
